WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.852
"I have to get to City Hall," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:05.853 --> 00:00:09.626
She rushed back to her friends.

3
00:00:09.627 --> 00:00:13.039
"Hey, guys, I just remembered something.

4
00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.188
I have to . . . uh . . . do a book report.

5
00:00:16.189 --> 00:00:20.979
See you later!"

6
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.725
Terrell watched Roxy run away.

7
00:00:23.726 --> 00:00:26.322
"That's weird," he thought.

8
00:00:26.323 --> 00:00:30.541
"Our teacher didn't assign a book report."

9
00:00:30.542 --> 00:00:32.944
Roxy arrived at City Hall.

10
00:00:32.945 --> 00:00:36.782
Detective Smith was talking to Mayor Bloom's assistant.

11
00:00:36.783 --> 00:00:43.131
". . . and after that," the assistant was saying, "Mayor Bloom ran out of City Hall."

12
00:00:43.132 --> 00:00:48.148
"I wonder why he stole the money," said Detective Smith.

13
00:00:48.149 --> 00:00:53.174
"Maybe Mayor Bloom was going to buy a new assistant," said Roxy.

14
00:00:53.175 --> 00:00:55.482
She glared at the assistant.

15
00:00:55.483 --> 00:00:57.498
"I think you're lying.

16
00:00:57.499 --> 00:00:59.961
Mayor Bloom is not a thief."

17
00:00:59.962 --> 00:01:01.923
The assistant frowned.

18
00:01:01.924 --> 00:01:05.161
"I am not lying," she said.

19
00:01:05.162 --> 00:01:08.124
"I'm as surprised as you are by this."

20
00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:12.332
"Ahem," said Detective Smith, looking at Roxy.

21
00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:15.491
"Arguing won't help, Rocket Girl."

22
00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.391
Roxy sighed.

23
00:01:17.392 --> 00:01:22.070
"You're right. Do you know where the mayor went?

24
00:01:22.071 --> 00:01:24.787
Did he leave any clues?"

25
00:01:24.788 --> 00:01:27.277
"No," said the assistant.

26
00:01:27.278 --> 00:01:30.801
"But he got a mysterious phone call before he took the money."

27
00:01:30.802 --> 00:01:36.296
"Who called him?" asked Detective Smith.

28
00:01:36.297 --> 00:01:40.585
The assistant checked the mayor's phone.

29
00:01:40.586 --> 00:01:44.831
"The call came from the lab at Metro City University."

30
00:01:44.832 --> 00:01:48.165
"Okay, Rocket Girl," said Detective Smith.

31
00:01:48.166 --> 00:01:55.245
"We need to go to the—Rocket Girl?"

32
00:01:55.246 --> 00:02:01.695
Roxy arrived at the Metro City University lab.

33
00:02:01.696 --> 00:02:04.628
Two large booths stood along one wall.

34
00:02:04.629 --> 00:02:08.617
Wires and coils connected the booths to a big computer.

35
00:02:08.618 --> 00:02:11.198
A man sat in front of the computer.

36
00:02:11.199 --> 00:02:14.321
He had black hair and thick glasses.

37
00:02:14.322 --> 00:02:18.011
"I was expecting you, Rocket Girl," said the man.

38
00:02:18.012 --> 00:02:20.852
"You must be looking for Mayor Bloom."

39
00:02:20.853 --> 00:02:25.759
"Who are you?" asked Roxy.

40
00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:29.806
The man smiled. "I'm Professor Ditto."

41
00:02:29.807 --> 00:02:32.615
Roxy heard a footstep behind her.

42
00:02:32.616 --> 00:02:35.275
She spun around and saw another man.

43
00:02:35.276 --> 00:02:38.182
He looked just like the first one.

44
00:02:38.183 --> 00:02:43.081
"I'm Professor Ditto too," said the new man.

45
00:02:43.082 --> 00:02:47.674
Another man entered the lab. "And so am I."

46
00:02:47.675 --> 00:02:50.150
Roxy blinked in surprise.

47
00:02:50.151 --> 00:02:52.714
That man was followed by more men.

48
00:02:52.715 --> 00:02:55.462
Every one of them looked the same.

49
00:02:55.463 --> 00:02:59.345
"They're all Professor Ditto!" thought Roxy.

50
00:02:59.346 --> 00:03:02.305
The men moved toward Roxy.

51
00:03:02.306 --> 00:03:07.635
She took a few steps back.

52
00:03:07.636 --> 00:03:11.472
Suddenly the professors pushed her into one of the booths.

53
00:03:11.473 --> 00:03:17.384
Roxy yelled as the door slammed shut.

54
00:03:17.385 --> 00:03:19.419
Electricity hummed.

55
00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:23.483
Bright lights flashed. Sparks flew.

56
00:03:23.484 --> 00:03:25.954
Then the lab was quiet.

57
00:03:25.955 --> 00:03:30.633
Roxy was taken out of her booth.

58
00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:33.281
She looked at the other booth.

59
00:03:33.282 --> 00:03:36.630
Someone stepped out of it.

60
00:03:36.631 --> 00:03:44.930
Roxy gasped. It was another Rocket Girl!

